{"id":"00174","root":"uni00174_1","name":{"ja":"沙耶ＮＥＯ","en":"Saya NEO"},"title":{"ja":"【報復娘】","en":"【Revenge Girl】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【報復娘】 沙耶ＮＥＯ","en":"【Revenge Girl】 Saya NEO"},"element":"Science","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["UFS"],"release":"2019-03-31","limited":true,"characterId":14,"profile":{"ja":"東京キングダムの地下実験施設に残っていた沙耶の細胞を米連が手に入れ、その実験データを元に新たに作り出した人工魔族。初代の覚醒状態における不安定さを払拭するために、人間体→覚醒体の変化を考えず、生物兵器として効率の良い運用を目指して開発された。しかし、実験途中で暴走、米連の研究施設を破壊して脱走する。かつての朧クローンのようなマスター制御も行われていないため、人が生み出したはぐれ魔族として気ままな殺戮を繰り返している。初代のように大げさな変化はできないが、その分、制御された魔力によって、初代以上の戦闘力を発揮する。","en":"Saya NEO is an artificial demon created by the U.S. alliance using cells from Saya that remained in the underground Tokyo Kingdom facility. Based on the original's awakening data, she was engineered to eliminate the instability of the first generation's awakening state, foregoing the human-to-awakened transformation and aiming for efficient use as a bio-weapon. However, she went berserk during testing, destroyed the U.S. research lab, and escaped. Lacking the master control once used on the original Oboro clone, she now roams as a rogue demon, indulging in wanton slaughter. Though she cannot undergo the dramatic transformations of the original, controlled demonic energy grants her combat power surpassing that of the first generation."},"illustrator":"カガミ","voiceActor":"川瀬ゆづき","forms":[{"id":"uni00174_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[856,1712],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[152,304],"def":[124,248],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["5","150001"],"evolve":[["evo00013",5],["evo00014",15],["evo00015",5],["evo00017",1]]},{"id":"uni00174_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1212,2424],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[239,478],"def":[183,366],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":35,"skills":["5","150001","150002"],"evolve":[["evo00014",10],["evo00015",15],["evo00016",4],["evo00017",2]]},{"id":"uni00174_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabe